    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Professor Lukoye Atwoli Dean, Aga Khan University (AKU) Medical College, East Africa has been appointed as an Honorary Professor in the Department of Psychiatry and Mental Health, Faculty of Health Sciences by the Council of the University of Cape Town. The appointment is for five years beginning June 1, 2022.",
